---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Maarten Belmans, Co-founder of Simply Enak',
  description: 'Maarten Belmans is the co-founder of Simply Enak and has worked in Malaysian food tourism since 2011. Meet the co-founder behind Simply Enak food tours.',
};

const breadcrumb = {
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Simply Enak', item: 'https://simplyenak.com/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'About', item: 'https://simplyenak.com/about/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 3, name: 'Maarten Belmans', item: 'https://simplyenak.com/about/maarten/' },
  ],
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata} structuredData={breadcrumb}>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative bg-[#1a1a1a] text-white overflow-hidden py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <p class="text-accent text-xs md:text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.25em] font-bold mb-5">Our Team</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold font-heading leading-tight mb-5" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.75rem);">Maarten Belmans</h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Co-founder, Operations & Growth, Simply Enak</p>
      <div class="mt-8 max-w-xs mx-auto flex items-center justify-center aspect-[3/4] rounded-lg bg-primary/20 border border-white/10"><span class="text-7xl font-heading font-bold text-white/40">M</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="bg-page border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-muted">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Home</a>
        <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        <a href="/about" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">About</a>
        <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        <span class="text-default font-semibold">Maarten Belmans</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Who is ... (entity facts) -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-heading text-default mb-8">Who Is Maarten Belmans?</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-default leading-relaxed">
        <p>Maarten Belmans is the co-founder of Simply Enak, a food tour company in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia. Maarten Belmans has worked in Malaysian food tourism since 2011, the year he and Pauline Lee founded Simply Enak together.</p>
        <p>Maarten Belmans runs the operations behind every Simply Enak tour: guide scheduling, vendor relationships and the development of new food tours in Kuala Lumpur, Penang and Melaka. His standard is simple: every stop is a stall the team would take their own families to.</p>
        <p>Maarten Belmans works with licensed local guides, including founder Pauline Lee, to deliver small-group and private Malaysian food tours. Maarten Belmans therefore is a Malaysian food tour operator and the co-founder of Simply Enak.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Story -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white dark:bg-[#1e1c1c]">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-heading text-default mb-8">Building Simply Enak Since 2011</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-default leading-relaxed">
        <p>Maarten joined Pauline in 2011 to turn her market walks into a tour company. From the first Chinatown routes to today's Kuala Lumpur, Penang and Melaka tours, he has spent more than a decade on the operational side of Malaysian food tourism.</p>
        <p>That work continues in the travel tools Simply Enak builds, such as the durian season guide When Is Durian Season, and in the vendor relationships across Chow Kit, Jalan Alor and George Town that make every tour possible.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Profiles / corroboration links -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#151313]">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold font-heading text-default mb-6">Find Maarten Belmans Online</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-default">
        <li><a href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g298570-d2414763-Reviews-Simply_Enak_Food_Experiences-Kuala_Lumpur_Wilayah_Persekutuan.html" class="text-primary hover:text-accent font-semibold transition-colors">Simply Enak on TripAdvisor &rarr;</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.getyourguide.com/simply-enak-food-experiences-s4050/" class="text-primary hover:text-accent font-semibold transition-colors">Simply Enak on GetYourGuide &rarr;</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about" class="text-primary hover:text-accent font-semibold transition-colors">About Simply Enak &rarr;</a></li>
        <li><a href="/tours" class="text-primary hover:text-accent font-semibold transition-colors">All Food Tours &rarr;</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-[#1a1a1a] py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-heading text-white mb-5">Taste Malaysia with the Simply Enak Team</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 leading-relaxed">Browse food tours led by Pauline, Trish and Simply Enak’s licensed guides.</p>
      <a href="/tours" class="inline-block bg-accent text-black font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-sm hover:bg-white transition-colors">See Food Tours</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
